  "fleet_local_transient_phases": ["submitting"],
  "invalid_restore": "An unrecognised journal schema, field set or phase blocks maintenance only; it is not deleted, rewritten, or replayed as an install/restart request and does not activate an actuator fence.",
  "interrupted_restore": "In-progress audit phases become interrupted without resuming the operation. A pending restart is observed, never reissued. Successful reboot verification requires a distinct process identity, expected running version, healthy HEO runtime and preserved settings.",
  "authority": "Status polling is read-only. Version selection does not install. Update/restart buttons require the actual current active administrator at both hub and node boundaries, and carry no device-control authority. HACS remains the installer; native HA backup/check/restart remain the lifecycle authorities."
}
